{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1203334-favorite-outcast-group","id":1203334,"title":"Favorite Outcast Group!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-05T02:21:03-07:00","id":1203334,"title":"Favorite Outcast Group!","content":"So in the new WFHW manuscript preview, we got a list of new Outcast groups, some being more developed and some being described with only a few lines. As such, it is only natural to ask which of those groups has caught your attention! For the purpose of this thread, I think we should exclude any of the &quot;main non Realm groups&quot;- so no Lookshy, Parsad or Forest Witches- as I wish to focus on the smaller organizations of Dragon Blooded. <br /> <br /> As for me, my top 3 favorites are the Wanasaan, because I love their weirdness and exorcist angle, the Cult of the Violet Fang, as the raksha connections just make them sound alien and alluring, and the Khamaseen Battalion, because roaming mercenaries who speak in lost languages just generates a great image IMO. Yeah, I like weird things, what can I say? :P<br /> <br /> So, what are your favorite groups?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T03:06:27-07:00","id":1203348,"title":"","content":"Yatani's Children and Heaven's Dragons because they are roles and tropes I used in my games/headcanon before we got official permission for them. I was always for Dragonblood, and even Lunars, being able to seek employ in Heaven. And Yatani's Children are alluring and fill that mystery Angle that I already steal from bastardizing certain Final Fantasy settings and such. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> And the Legion of Saloy Hin because its a fun new army of pragmatic treasure hunters carving out their own kingdom and maybe becoming the biggest non Dynasty Thing since the 7th Legion, and no worry about Bagrash Kol wiping these guys out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T20:45:26-07:00","id":1203677,"title":"","content":"Haven't read the book so can't really speak on the subject, though i'm itching to go back to some old bits from past games like the Rutanjali brood, the Sinasi with their cadet house and bandit-kings branches, the Olchilike-Kings of Enkidu, the House of the Windtamers and other homebrewed deliciousness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T20:49:58-07:00","id":1203679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1203334-favorite-outcast-group?p=1203677#post1203677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Haven't read the book so can't really speak on the subject, though i'm itching to go back to some old bits from past games like the Rutanjali brood, the Sinasi with their cadet house and bandit-kings branches, the Olchilike-Kings of Enkidu, the House of the Windtamers and other homebrewed deliciousness.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have never heard of any of these, please tell me more.<br /> <br /> To the OP: The Violet Fang, becasue I have a northern game centered on Fae at the moment and that directs my intreast. The Yatani are cool, but I get the uncomfortable feeling their a hook--which is not something I like with &quot;mysterious past&quot; types. I'd like hints of their world damnit! Heaven's Dragons are intreasting, because they imply the oppisite(Malfeas away!) and the nomads would be neat, an intrasting take on a &quot;lost legion&quot; story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}